{"id":"polvo","lemma":"polvo","pos":"noun","rank":1213,"glosses":["dust (fine, dry particles of matter found in the air and covering the surface of objects)","powder, dust (fine particles of a dry substance)","fuck, screw (sexual intercourse)"],"ipa":"/ˈpolbo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"polvos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-polvo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom está hecho polvo.","en":"Tom's flaky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302208"},{"text":"Mis botas tienen polvo.","en":"My boots are dusty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722256"},{"text":"El mobiliario tenía polvo.","en":"The furniture was dusty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804045"},{"text":"Tengo la garganta hecha polvo.","en":"I've got a frog in my throat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611734"},{"text":"Quítale el polvo a la estantería.","en":"Dust the shelves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704814"}]}